<title>USA: Archer Daniels names Rice to head new unit.</title>
<headline>Archer Daniels names Rice to head new unit.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said on Thursday it named John Rice as president of the company's newly formed ADM Food Oils division.</p>
<p>It said the division will include all of the company's packaged oils and vegetable oil products.</p>
<p>Rice, a corporate vice president, has been responsible for all of the food company's North and South American crude and refined oil sales since 1992.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
